---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/common/Breadcrumb.astro';
import { getBreadcrumbSchema, getLocalBusinessSchema } from '../utils/seo';

const businessSchema = getLocalBusinessSchema();
const breadcrumbSchema = getBreadcrumbSchema([
  { name: 'Beranda', url: 'https://agroprimagreenhouse.com/' },
  { name: 'Wilayah Layanan', url: 'https://agroprimagreenhouse.com/wilayah-layanan/' },
]);

const wilayahKeywords = [
  'wilayah layanan greenhouse',
  'pengiriman material greenhouse',
  'kargo plastik uv luar pulau',
  'jasa greenhouse jawa timur',
  'jasa greenhouse sumatera kalimantan sulawesi',
  'ekspedisi kargo pertanian',
  'agro prima greenhouse',
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Wilayah Layanan Greenhouse &amp; Ekspedisi Kargo Indonesia - Agro Prima Greenhouse"
  description="Layanan pembuatan greenhouse &amp; pengiriman material konstruksi ke Jawa, Bali, Sumatera, Kalimantan, Sulawesi, hingga Papua via kargo darat &amp; laut terpercaya."
  keywords={wilayahKeywords}
  jsonLd={[businessSchema, breadcrumbSchema]}
>
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-6 pb-24">
    <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: 'Wilayah Layanan' }]} />

    <div class="my-10 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-3">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-800 border border-emerald-200/60">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600"></span>
        Jangkauan Logistik &amp; Kontraktor Nasional
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-zinc-900 tracking-tight">
        Layanan Pembuatan Greenhouse &amp; Pengiriman Material Seluruh Indonesia
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
        Berbasis di Kedungkandang, Kota Malang, kami membangun sistem pengiriman kargo dan instalasi proyek terstruktur agar petani dan pelaku agribisnis di seluruh nusantara dapat mengakses material pertanian berkualitas dan konstruksi greenhouse terstandar.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Logistics Editorial Hero Frame -->
    <div class="my-8 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-zinc-200/80 bg-zinc-100 shadow-sm relative group">
      <img
        src="/images/wilayah/logistik-ekspedisi-greenhouse.webp"
        alt="Gudang Distribusi Logistik dan Pengiriman Material Greenhouse Agro Prima"
        width="1400"
        height="788"
        class="w-full aspect-[16/9] sm:aspect-[21/9] object-cover group-hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform duration-700 ease-out"
        loading="eager"
        decoding="async"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-zinc-950/80 via-zinc-950/20 to-transparent flex flex-col justify-end p-5 sm:p-7 text-white">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-300">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
            Jalur Distribusi Kargo Aman
          </span>
          <span class="text-zinc-400 text-xs hidden sm:inline">&bull; Ekspedisi Darat, Kereta Api &amp; Tol Laut</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm md:text-base font-semibold text-white/95 mt-1 max-w-xl leading-snug">
          Kemasan rol plastik UV, paranet, selang drip, dan profil lock diperkuat proteksi berlapis tahan guncangan pengiriman antar pulau.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Key Delivery Mechanisms -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 sm:gap-8 my-12">
      <div class="p-7 sm:p-8 rounded-xl bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center border border-emerald-100/80">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-700" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16V6a1 1 0 00-1-1H4a1 1 0 00-1 1v10a1 1 0 001 1h1m8-1a1 1 0 01-1 1H9m4-1V8a1 1 0 011-1h2.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l3.414 3.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V16a1 1 0 01-1 1h-1m-6-1a1 1 0 001 1h1M5 17a2 2 0 104 0m-4 0a2 2 0 114 0m6 0a2 2 0 104 0m-4 0a2 2 0 114 0"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900">Area Malang Raya &amp; Jatim</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
            Pengiriman langsung via armada operasional kami, ojek online kargo, atau ambil sendiri di gudang Kedungkandang. Layanan same-day / next-day dispatch untuk material greenhouse ready stock.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-3 border-t border-zinc-100 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700">
          Malang, Batu, Pasuruan, Blitar, Kediri, Surabaya &amp; sekitarnya
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-7 sm:p-8 rounded-xl bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center border border-emerald-100/80">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-700" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 17a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM19 17a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"/>
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16V6a1 1 0 00-1-1H4a1 1 0 00-1 1v10a1 1 0 001 1h1m8-1a1 1 0 01-1 1H9m4-1h3.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l3.414 3.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V16a1 1 0 01-1 1h-1"/>
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M1 9h3m0 4h3"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900">Pulau Jawa, Madura &amp; Bali</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
            Didukung kemitraan ekspedisi kargo truk reguler (Indah Kargo, Baraka, Dakota, Kobra, Truk Balen). Biaya per kilogram sangat hemat untuk gulungan plastik UV, roll paranet, dan mulsa.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-3 border-t border-zinc-100 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700">
          Jawa Tengah, Jawa Barat, DIY Yogyakarta, Jabodetabek, Banten &amp; Bali
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-7 sm:p-8 rounded-xl bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center border border-emerald-100/80">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-700" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 18c2.5 0 2.5 2 5 2s2.5-2 5-2 2.5 2 5 2 2.5-2 5-2M3 14c2.5 0 2.5 2 5 2s2.5-2 5-2 2.5 2 5 2 2.5-2 5-2"/>
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 14l2-8h10l2 8M9 6V3h6v3"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900">Luar Pulau (Kargo Laut &amp; Kontainer)</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
            Pengiriman via pelabuhan Tanjung Perak Surabaya menggunakan kapal kargo atau kontainer LCL/FCL. Packing ekstra rapi dengan proteksi berlapis tahan guncangan laut.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-3 border-t border-zinc-100 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700">
          Sumatera, Kalimantan, Sulawesi, NTB, NTT, Maluku &amp; Papua
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA Box -->
    <div class="p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-900 text-white border border-zinc-800 text-center space-y-4 shadow-xl">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-950/80 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-700/50">
        Konsultasi Ekspedisi &amp; Ongkir
      </span>
      <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">Ingin Mengetahui Jadwal &amp; Estimasi Ongkir ke Wilayah Anda?</h3>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-300 max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Kirimkan alamat kecamatan dan kabupaten Anda ke WhatsApp kami untuk pengecekan rute armada ekspedisi paling hemat dan aman.
      </p>
      <div class="pt-2">
        <a
          href="https://wa.me/6285183002070?text=Halo%20Agro%20Prima%20Greenhouse%2C%20saya%20ingin%20cek%20estimasi%20ongkir%20kargo%20ke%20daerah%20saya."
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white font-semibold text-sm transition-all shadow-lg hover:shadow-emerald-900/50 select-none"
        >
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-200" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
            <path d="M12.04 2c-5.46 0-9.91 4.45-9.91 9.91 0 1.75.46 3.45 1.32 4.95L2.05 22l5.25-1.38c1.45.79 3.08 1.21 4.74 1.21 5.46 0 9.91-4.45 9.91-9.91 0-2.65-1.03-5.14-2.9-7.01A9.816 9.816 0 0012.04 2z"/>
          </svg>
          <span>Cek Ongkir Kargo via WhatsApp</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
